    "tradition": "Hermetic Order of the Golden Dawn (1888) / Crowley Thoth (1944)",
    "notes": "Hebrew letters for the 22 Major Arcana follow the Golden Dawn assignment (Atu I = Beth, etc.). Crowley swapped Tzaddi (path 28) and Heh (path 15), so The Star = Heh (Aquarius) and The Emperor = Tzaddi (Aries) in Thoth. The GD-orthodox assignment is given here."
